==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|overlien}}, {{m|enm|overliggen}}, equivalent to {{pre|en|over|lie|gloss2=to be reclined}}. Compare {{cog|fy|oerlizze}}, {{cog|de|überliegen}}, {{cog|da|overligge}}, {{cog|sv|överligga}}, {{cog|no|overligge}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌoʊvɚˈlaɪ/}}
* {{hyphenation|en|over|lie}}
* {{rhymes|en|aɪ|s=3}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|overlies|overlying|overlay|overlain}}

# To [[lie]] over or upon
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[suffocate]] by lying upon

